xperiences:Enhanced impact and hitting sensationsImproved running responsivenessRefined keyboard controlsFull keyboard support for all in-game actionsR","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:54:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689878","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5118580-1846651706689786","game_id":"steam-5118580","kind":"update","title":"2026.10.19 - Demo Update Notice","summary":"2026.10.19 Update Details:Improved hit feedbackImproved run responsivenessDecreased enemy attack damage","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:23:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689786","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5118580-1846651706686274","game_id":"steam-5118580","kind":"update","title":"October 18, 2026 - Demo Version Update Notice","summary":"October 18, 2026 Update NotesAdded a brief description of each character's combat style to the Character Selection screen.A combat guide overview will now be displayed upon entering a battle zone.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:26:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686274","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5118580-1846018067944641","game_id":"steam-5118580","kind":"update","title":"Oct 14, 2026 - Demo Game Update","summary":"Oct 14, 2026 UpdateUI navigation via keyboard support.Full game control available using only the keyboard.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944641","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5118580-1846018067943209","game_id":"steam-5118580","kind":"announcement","title":"ARCHSCROLL Demo Event: Play the Demo, Share Your Feedback & Win a Game Key! 🔑","summary":"Play the demo of ARCHSCROLL now! Your valuable feedback will help us greatly improve the game for its official release. (Estimated survey time: 3 minutes)To show our appreciation, we are holding a lucky draw for everyone who plays the demo and completes the survey!🎁 Event Reward: A free full game key at official launch 📝 How to Participate: Download and play the demo on Steam. When you exit the game, the survey page will open automatically in your browser. Simply complete and submit the form! 🔗 ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T07:34:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943209","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5118580-1846018067932880","game_id":"steam-5118580","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest October 2026 Participation & Demo Key Distribution","summary":"ARCHSCROLL is participating in the October 2026 Steam Next Fest!We have successfully rolled out several updates and improvements to our existing demo. If you've been following ARCHSCROLL, we’d love for you to play the demo and add the game to your Wishlist if you enjoy it!While the demo is already live and free to download directly on our Steam page, we have also generated dedicated Demo Keys for anyone who might specifically need or prefer one for their library.If you would like a demo key, ple","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T10:42:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":